# Known development secrets (ADR-036 §6, REQ-183 AC6).
# SHA-256 hashes (hex) of every secret value used in compose.dev.yaml, dev/ and the
# realm file. The application refuses to start outside the profile 'dev' with any of
# these values; scripts/check_dev_secrets.py fails if a development secret is missing.
# Never add plain values to this file.
